<title>USA: Allied Waste North America sets $525 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Allied Waste North America sets $525 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Allied Waste North America priced in the 144A private placement market on Monday via Goldman Sachs &amp; Co, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER ALLIED WASTE NORTH AMERICA</p>
<p>AMT $525 MLN	 COUPON 10.25 PCT  MATURITY 12/01/2006</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 10.25 PCT   PAY FREQ N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD N.A.	 CALLABLE AFTER FIVE YEARS</p>
<p>NOTES: MAKE-WHOLE CALL AT U.S. TREASURIES AT 75 BASIS POINTS</p>
<p>PRIOR 12/01/2001</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
